OL,3,GNEWSABus changes 'inexcusable' as
OL,4,Achildren left behind
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents and teachers have said it is
OL,7,F"inexcusable" that children are being
OL,8,Fleft on the side of a busy road because
OL,9,Ftheir bus to and from school is not big
OL,10,Fenough.
OL,12,FBus operator Stagecoach changed the
OL,13,Fvehicle operating the 120 service from
OL,14,FKingswear to Paignton from a
OL,15,Fdouble-decker bus to a single-decker
OL,16,Fbus and now parents say between 10 and
OL,17,F20 children are being left behind every
OL,18,Fday.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
