OL,3,GNEWSABus changes 'inexcusable' as
OL,4,Achildren left behind
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarigold, 13, said: "Sometimes,
OL,7,Fespecially after school, it's quite
OL,8,Fviolent with lots of people pushing
OL,9,Feach other just to get a seat on the
OL,10,Fbus." Her mother, Ronnie, said the
OL,11,Fsituation is "inexcusable".
OL,13,FStagecoach said it understood the
OL,14,F"frustration" and was working to find a
OL,15,Fsolution.
